{"id":"7ade1cc62edc29c7","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-church-undecidability.md","title":"Church Undecidability Theorem","display":"thm-church-undecidability — Church Undecidability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-church-undecidability","aliases":["57-thm-church-undecidability"],"display":"thm-church-undecidability — Church Undecidability Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-logically-valid]]","[[57-df-arith0]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-church-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-church-undecidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-church-undecidability — Church Undecidability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"337462c47a6e0696\" href=\"?note=337462c47a6e0696\" title=\"57-df-abstract-logic\">57-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f51dfe3ccfa662cb\" href=\"?note=f51dfe3ccfa662cb\" title=\"57-df-logically-valid\">57-df-logically-valid</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" href=\"?note=ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" title=\"57-df-arith0\">57-df-arith0</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限的一阶关系语言并至少含一个二元关系符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" href=\"?note=ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" title=\"57-df-arith0\">57-df-arith0</a> 的可判定数值集合类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 为通常非空结构上的一阶有效性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为下面的数值集合谓词，原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Undec}\\)</span> 在本文件的数值集合类型上保留为该谓词的别名；与理论类型的调用相区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_{\\mathrm{FO}}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S:\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Val}_{\\mathrm{FO}}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S:\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{Rec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{Rec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Undec}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}(g[\\mathrm{Val}_{\\mathrm{FO}}]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Undec}(g[\\mathrm{Val}_{\\mathrm{FO}}]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语言条件不能省略；并非每个固定的一阶语言都有不可判定的有效句子问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-logically-valid","status":"resolved","id":"f51dfe3ccfa662cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-logically-valid]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arith0","status":"resolved","id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arith0]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为有限的一阶关系语言并至少含一个二元关系符号；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的可判定数值集合类。$\\models$ 为通常非空结构上的一阶有效性；$\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}$ 为下面的数值集合谓词，原 $\\mathrm{Undec}$ 在本文件的数值集合类型上保留为该谓词的别名；与理论类型的调用相区分。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arith0","status":"resolved","id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为有限的一阶关系语言并至